        "derivation": "Create accepts version 1 and the constructor requires positive retention. Actual checkConfiguration validates the supplied membership. The harness records successful Create, complete Write, successful descriptor closure, enabled synchronization, and a configuration index no greater than the snapshot index. The acquired implementation buffers writes over stateFile and returns from failed finalization before reaching rename. The first Close error and absent published directory are observed prerequisites. Legal conditions constrain these measured experiment inputs and prerequisites; they neither assume the second Close result nor require Open to fail. They do not establish that private descriptor closure is an authorized production fault.",
